			<item>
				<title>समीची नामासि</title>
				<link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/AryaH/hindukaH/classes/dik/yajuH/samIchI_nAmAsi/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/AryaH/hindukaH/classes/dik/yajuH/samIchI_nAmAsi/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;हरदत्तो &lt;a href=&#34;https://archive.org/stream/EKAGNIKANDABHASHYAMSAMSKRUTHAM/EKAGNIKANDA%20BHASHYAM%20SAMSKRUTHAM#page/n173/mode/2up&#34;&gt;ऽत्र&lt;/a&gt;।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;2&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_17/14_samIchI_nAmAsi.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h2&gt;१४ समीची नामासि ...{Loading}...&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;स॒मीची॒ नामा॑सि॒ प्राची॒ दिक्। तस्या॑स् ते॒ ऽग्निर् अधि॑पतिर्, असि॒तो र॑क्षि॒ता।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;5&#34; unfilled=&#34;&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_17/yash_chAdhipatiH.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h7&gt;यश् चाधि॑पति॒र् ...{Loading}...&lt;/h7&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;यश् चाधि॑पति॒र्, यश् च॑ गो॒प्ता - ताभ्यां॒ नम॒स्, तौ नो॑ मृडयताम्।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ते यं द्वि॒ष्मो, यश् च॑ नो॒ द्वेष्टि॒ - तं वां॒ जंभे॑ दधामि ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;2&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_17/15_ojasvinI_nAmAsi.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h2&gt;१५ ओजस्विनी नामासि ...{Loading}...&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;ओजस्वि᳓नी ना᳓मासि दक्षिणा᳓ दि᳓क्।  &#xA;त᳓स्यास् त इ᳓न्द्रो᳓ऽधिपतिः, पृ᳓दाकू रक्षिता᳓  &#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;6&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_17/yash_chAdhipatiH.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h5&gt;य᳓श् चा᳓धिपतिर् ...{Loading}...&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;य᳓श् चा᳓धिपतिर्, य᳓श् च गोप्ता᳓ - ता᳓भ्यां न᳓मस्, तौ᳓ नो मृडयताम्।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ते᳓ यं᳓ द्विष्मो᳓, य᳓श् च नो द्वे᳓ष्टि - तं᳓ वां जं᳓भे दधामि ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
